WEBVTT

01:04:29.958 --> 01:04:32.268
You know, do you decide?

01:04:32.292 --> 01:04:35.059
Are you sending money
over to the old country

01:04:35.083 --> 01:04:37.643
and there's a whole family
that lives on your work?

01:04:37.667 --> 01:04:40.268
That's going to change if you -- you know.

01:04:40.292 --> 01:04:44.143
It's like, where is the locus of control
in those four things,

01:04:44.167 --> 01:04:45.768
which I think are very beautiful,

01:04:45.792 --> 01:04:47.393
you are the locus of control.

01:04:47.417 --> 01:04:51.309
In many people's lives,
that is not the reality.

01:04:51.333 --> 01:04:54.643
There are lots of other things
that are affecting your decision.

01:04:54.667 --> 01:04:57.226
Maybe at this moment, I would leave.

01:04:57.250 --> 01:04:58.934
If it was up to me, I would leave.

01:04:58.958 --> 01:05:02.476
But given the circumstances of my life,
this is not the right moment.